236
00:13:40,020 --> 00:13:41,020
All clear.

237
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:46,280
Open up for them.

238
00:13:50,950 --> 00:13:51,950
Good lad.

239
00:13:58,250 --> 00:14:00,130
[WIND WHISTLING]

240
