252
00:14:30,740 --> 00:14:32,780
SPIKE: It's the only way to the mainland.

253
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,160
But we can only get here in low tide.

254
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:38,250
{\an8}In high tide,

255
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:38,250
